        "TileImage": "$($repository 4c0b5fd0-f546-4855-b841-3edb76f2db10).Image",
        "Description": "[Complication]: Electrocutions must require a puddle.\r[Complication]: You may not start as a surgeon.\rAn arachnophobe visiting GAMA was shocked to find the hospital&apos;s resident spider (Timothy) crawling around in her cabinet. Initially the blame went to the cleaning staff but they soon heard Satou brag about being responsible to our client&apos;s bodyguards. She wants the targets discreetly punished, but just in case her father finds out and freezes the card, take the helicopter for her to sell.",
